---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = "Mortgage Broker Miami Florida | Home Loans, Refinance & Preapproval";
const description = "Miami mortgage broker helping buyers compare FHA, conventional, VA, jumbo, condo, refinance, DSCR, bank statement, and foreign national loan options.";
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
<main id="main"><section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Miami mortgage broker</p><h1>Mortgage Broker in Miami, Florida</h1><p>Compare home loan, refinance, condo, jumbo, FHA, VA, DSCR, bank statement, and foreign national mortgage options with a Miami-focused mortgage professional.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="start.html">Start Mortgage Review</a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="get-preapproved-miami.html">Get Preapproved</a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="mortgage-calculator-florida.html">Calculate Payment</a></div><div class="trust-row"><span class="trust-pill">Matthew Gromadzki</span><span class="trust-pill">NMLS #2560919</span><span class="trust-pill">Miami · Florida</span></div></div><form class="lead-form"><h2>Compare Miami Mortgage Options</h2><p>Answer a few basics and we’ll review the best mortgage path for your scenario.</p><label>Loan goal<select><option>Select one</option><option>Buying a home</option><option>Refinancing</option><option>Condo financing</option></select></label><div class="form-row"><label>Purchase price / value<input placeholder="$650,000"></label><label>Down payment / equity<input placeholder="$100,000"></label></div><div class="form-row"><label>Credit score range<select><option>Select range</option><option>760+</option><option>720–759</option><option>680–719</option><option>640–679</option></select></label><label>Property city<input placeholder="Miami"></label></div><div class="form-row"><label>Name<input></label><label>Phone<input></label></div><label>Email<input type="email"></label><button class="btn btn-primary full" type="button">Start Mortgage Review</button><p class="form-note">Preview only. Production form connects to your lead endpoint.</p></form></div></section><section class="section "><div class="container"><div class="kicker-grid"><div class="kicker-card"><strong>Condo-heavy market</strong><span>Building review matters in Brickell, Edgewater, Miami Beach, Aventura and Sunny Isles.</span></div><div class="kicker-card"><strong>Jumbo loan planning</strong><span>Luxury buyers need reserve, documentation, and cash-to-close planning.</span></div><div class="kicker-card"><strong>Self-employed buyers</strong><span>Bank statement, 1099, and business-owner files need strategy.</span></div><div class="kicker-card"><strong>Investor financing</strong><span>DSCR, rental condos, and cash-out refinance require different underwriting.</span></div></div></div></section><section class="section soft"><div class="container two-col"><article class="prose"><p class="eyebrow">Miami mortgage strategy</p><h2>A mortgage site built around how Miami buyers actually finance property</h2><p>Miami mortgage financing is not one-size-fits-all. A buyer purchasing a Brickell condo, a family buying in Kendall, a veteran buying in Homestead, a business owner buying in Coral Gables, and an investor buying a rental property in North Miami may all need different loan strategies.</p><p>The goal of this site is to answer real borrower questions before they become closing problems: payment, cash to close, condo eligibility, FHA vs conventional, jumbo limits, bank statement options, DSCR loans, and refinance strategy.</p><h2>What makes financing in Miami-Dade different</h2><p>Miami-Dade has high condo density, luxury pricing pockets, investor activity, foreign buyer demand, first-time buyer affordability pressure, and property insurance complexity. Generic national mortgage advice doesn't fully answer these local questions.</p></article><aside><div class="content-card"><h2>Best starting points</h2><ul><li><a href="mortgage-broker-miami.html">Mortgage Broker Miami</a></li><li><a href="get-preapproved-miami.html">Get Preapproved in Miami</a></li><li><a href="miami-mortgage-rates.html">Miami Mortgage Rates</a></li><li><a href="mortgage-calculator-florida.html">Florida Mortgage Calculator</a></li><li><a href="condo-loans-miami.html">Condo Loans Miami</a></li><li><a href="jumbo-loans-miami.html">Jumbo Loans Miami</a></li></ul></div></aside></div></section><section class="section soft"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Local expertise</p><h2>Mortgage help across every Miami-Dade community</h2><p class="muted">From Brickell and Coral Gables to Hialeah, Homestead, Doral, and the Beaches, you get financing guidance specific to your city and property type across all 34 Miami-Dade communities.</p><p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="miami-dade-mortgage-broker.html">View All Miami-Dade Mortgage Areas</a></p></div></section><section class="section "><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Loan options</p><h2>Compare Miami mortgage programs</h2><div class="card-grid"><a class="feature-card" href="fha-loan-miami.html"><p class="eyebrow">FHA</p><h3>FHA Loans Miami</h3><p>Low-down-payment options, FHA condo checks, and first-time buyer planning.</p><span>Learn more →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="condo-loans-miami.html"><p class="eyebrow">Condos</p><h3>Condo Loans Miami</h3><p>Warrantable, non-warrantable, FHA, jumbo, and investment condo scenarios.</p><span>Learn more →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="jumbo-loans-miami.html"><p class="eyebrow">Jumbo</p><h3>Jumbo Loans Miami</h3><p>Luxury home and condo financing with reserves, assets, and high-balance planning.</p><span>Learn more →</span></a></div></div></section><section class="section "><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Keep comparing</p><h2>Related mortgage pages</h2><div class="card-grid small-grid"><a class="mini-card" href="mortgage-broker-miami.html">Mortgage Broker Miami<span>→</span></a><a class="mini-card" href="fha-loan-miami.html">FHA Loans Miami<span>→</span></a><a class="mini-card" href="condo-loans-miami.html">Condo Loans Miami<span>→</span></a><a class="mini-card" href="jumbo-loans-miami.html">Jumbo Loans Miami<span>→</span></a><a class="mini-card" href="miami-mortgage-rates.html">Miami Mortgage Rates<span>→</span></a><a class="mini-card" href="get-preapproved-miami.html">Get Preapproved Miami<span>→</span></a></div></div></section></main><section class="section soft"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Mortgage guides</p><h2>Miami mortgage guides to help you plan</h2><p>Research FHA limits, condo financing, jumbo requirements, down payment assistance, first-time buyer steps, investor loans, and refinance comparisons.</p></div><div class="card-grid"><a class="feature-card" href="miami-mortgage-guides.html"><h3>All Miami Mortgage Guides</h3><p>Browse the supporting content library behind the main mortgage service pages.</p><span>Open guides →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="condo-financing-miami.html"><h3>Condo Financing Miami</h3><p>Review condo questionnaire, reserves, insurance, litigation, and non-warrantable condo issues.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="fha-loan-limits-miami-dade-county.html"><h3>FHA Loan Limits Miami-Dade</h3><p>Understand FHA loan limit planning and how it connects to purchase price and loan type.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a></div></div></section><section class="section soft"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Tools &amp; reviews</p><h2>Mortgage tools and scenario reviews</h2><p>Get specific with a preapproval quiz, condo loan review, jumbo review, self-employed and investor reviews, refinance analysis, payment review, and a document checklist.</p></div><div class="card-grid"><a class="feature-card" href="mortgage-tools.html"><h3>Miami Mortgage Tools</h3><p>Open the hub for quote, preapproval, calculator, and scenario-review paths.</p><span>Open tools →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="miami-condo-loan-review.html"><h3>Miami Condo Loan Review</h3><p>Capture condo buyers who need borrower and building review before relying on a loan quote.</p><span>Open review →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="documents-needed-for-mortgage-miami.html"><h3>Documents Needed for a Mortgage</h3><p>Give buyers a practical checklist before preapproval or underwriting.</p><span>Open checklist →</span></a></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
